{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生の方、お仕事やバイトの方、頑張って下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も勉強やお仕事頑張りますので一緒に頑張りましょう〜♪★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の地震心配してくれてありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も大丈夫だったみたいでほっとしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントに準備しておいたほうがいい物が書いてあったので買いたそうと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元は地震があまりないので東京に来てからは本当に地震が多くてビックリしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんサッカー見ましたか!?\nサンフレッチェ頑張っててかっこ良かったですねぇ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人TVの前で叫びまくっておりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近所迷惑じゃなかったかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜質問返し〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q個人PVはどのtype？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＡtypeCです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qどの髪型の男性がよい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ自分の好きな髪型でいいと思いますよー♪特に私は好みはないです！\n似合う髪型をすればいいと思いまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q握手しにいこうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ是非来てください♪待ってますッ♪\n良かったらコメント名も教えてくれたら嬉しいな〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qサソリ以外のものも食べたのかな？\nＡ見てからのお楽しみ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qそのうち乃木坂で一番短髪になってしまう？ん？男役ねらっている？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ特にねらってません！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q身長は伸びましたか？\nＡのびたとおもいます！計ってないけど！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qいい点とれそう？\nＡ漢字のテストいい点数だったーヤッター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qメンバーと専用バスで移動する時『宜しくお願いします』『ありがとうございます』言えてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ礼儀なんで言ってますよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q新しく行く美容院緊張しない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａします〜でもずっといけばなれるからッ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qサンタさんのプレゼント何たのんだー？それとも頼まない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ頼みました〜！頼んだ物はナイショッ♪今年もサンタさん来ると良いなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q試験中かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ試験中ではないけど毎週沢山テストあります(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q洋服はどこのブランドが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａう〜ん色々〜\nリズリサとかイングとかハニーバンチかなぁ......？この前そこにトマトおね〜ちゃんと109にいったんだぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q地震大丈夫だった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ大丈夫でした\n電車に乗ってて全然気づかなかったぁ！苦笑\nろってぃーと、とまとおねーちゃんと三人で乗ってたんだぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qもちつきしたことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａあります〜、おばぁちゃん家の近くのおばぁちゃん家でみんなでおもちつきやらせてもらったことあるー\nまたお餅つきして食べたい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の質問ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ全部終わってないので待っててねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑市来のれなおさんとだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の帰りに、ちょっと用事をしてたら、皆と帰るの出遅れちゃって、\n心細くて、どうしよ〜って思ってたら、れなりんが一人でまあやのことを待っててくれたの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまに大好きだーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/8028548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"